<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Detty Savira Wardhani — Logbook Kreatif</title>
<meta name="description" content="Logbook kreatif Detty Savira Wardhani — Graphic Design, Copywriting, Social Media Management, Content Planning, dan Video Editing/Reels.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0B2E33">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ccircle cx='50' cy='50' r='46' fill='%230B2E33' stroke='%23C9A227' stroke-width='4'/%3E%3Cpath d='M50 14 L58 50 L50 86 L42 50 Z' fill='%232EC4B6'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400..900;1,9..144,400..900&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --deep-tide:#0B2E33;
    --deep-tide-2:#0F3A40;
    --lagoon:#2EC4B6;
    --sand:#F4EDE0;
    --brass:#C9A227;
    --coral:#F2542D;
    --foam:#B9E5E8;
    --ink:#0B2E33;
    --max:1080px;
    --radius:18px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--sand);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    margin:0;
    line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    color:var(--brass);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.6em;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:22px;height:1px;
    background:var(--brass);
    display:inline-block;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}
  section, header, footer{position:relative;}

  /* ---------- reduced motion ---------- */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation:none !important; transition:none !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- tide gauge (scroll indicator) ---------- */
  .tide-gauge{
    position:fixed;
    right:14px;
    top:50%;
    transform:translateY(-50%);
    width:6px;
    height:180px;
    border-radius:6px;
    background:rgba(11,46,51,0.12);
    z-index:60;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .tide-fill{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;
    height:0%;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--lagoon), var(--brass));
    border-radius:6px;
    transition:height 0.08s linear;
  }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .tide-gauge{display:none;} }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  .compass-nav{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(244,237,224,0.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,46,51,0.08);
  }
  .compass-nav .wrap{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    height:64px;
  }
  .nav-brand{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    text-decoration:none;
  }
  .nav-brand svg{width:26px;height:26px;animation:spin 60s linear infinite;}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:26px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  .nav-links a{
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:0.82rem;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    opacity:0.6;
    position:relative;
    padding-bottom:4px;
    transition:opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:2px;width:0;
    background:var(--coral);transition:width 0.25s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active{opacity:1;}
  .nav-links a.active::after{width:100%;}
  .nav-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;}
  .nav-toggle span{display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);margin:5px 0;}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .nav-links{
      position:absolute;top:64px;left:0;right:0;
      flex-direction:column;gap:0;
      background:var(--sand);
      max-height:0;overflow:hidden;
      transition:max-height 0.3s ease;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,46,51,0.08);
    }
    .nav-links.open{max-height:320px;}
    .nav-links li{width:100%;}
    .nav-links a{display:block;padding:16px 28px;opacity:0.8;}
    .nav-toggle{display:block;}
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% -10%, var(--foam) 0%, transparent 55%), var(--sand);
    padding-top:64px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .bubbles{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
  .bubble{
    position:absolute;border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(46,196,182,0.35), rgba(46,196,182,0.05));
    animation:rise linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes rise{
    from{transform:translateY(0) translateX(0);opacity:0;}
    10%{opacity:0.8;}
    90%{opacity:0.5;}
    to{transform:translateY(-110vh) translateX(20px);opacity:0;}
  }
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .monogram{
    width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--deep-tide);
    color:var(--sand);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.6rem;
    border:3px solid var(--brass);
    margin-bottom:28px;
    transform:rotate(-6deg);
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    margin:14px 0 6px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--lagoon);}
  .tagline-badge{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    background:var(--deep-tide);color:var(--sand);
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;
    margin:16px 0 22px;
  }
  .tagline-badge::before{content:"⚓";font-size:0.9rem;}
  .hero p.lede{
    max-width:540px;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:rgba(11,46,51,0.8);
    margin-bottom:34px;
  }
  .stamp-btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    background:var(--coral);color:var(--sand);
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:14px 26px;
    border-radius:10px;
    border:2px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
    transition:transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .stamp-btn:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--ink);}
  .stamp-btn.ghost{
    background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);
    box-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(11,46,51,0.25);
  }
  .stamp-btn.ghost:hover{box-shadow:2px 2px 0 rgba(11,46,51,0.25);}
  .stamp-btn.disabled{
    opacity:0.5;cursor:not-allowed;box-shadow:none;border-style:dashed;
  }
  .stamp-btn.disabled:hover{transform:none;}

  .wave-divider{display:block;width:100%;line-height:0;margin-top:-2px;}
  .wave-divider svg{width:100%;height:70px;display:block;}
  .wave-anim path{animation:wave-move 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;}
  @keyframes wave-move{
    from{d:path("M0,40 C 200,90 400,0 720,40 C 1040,80 1240,0 1440,40 L1440,100 L0,100 Z");}
    to{d:path("M0,40 C 200,0 400,90 720,40 C 1040,0 1240,80 1440,40 L1440,100 L0,100 Z");}
  }

  /* ---------- generic page/section ---------- */
  .page{padding:120px 0 100px;}
  .page.tide{background:var(--deep-tide);color:var(--sand);}
  .page.tide .eyebrow{color:var(--brass);}
  .page-head{margin-bottom:56px;max-width:640px;}
  .page-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,2.8rem);margin-top:12px;}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;}
  .reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

  /* ---------- about ---------- */
  .about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:start;}
  .about-grid p{font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 18px;}
  .coord-card{
    background:var(--deep-tide);color:var(--sand);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:28px;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    line-height:2;
  }
  .coord-card .dot{color:var(--lagoon);}
  @media (max-width:820px){ .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- skills / kelengkapan ---------- */
  .kit-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
    margin-bottom:64px;
  }
  .kit-card{
    background:var(--deep-tide-2);
    border:1px solid rgba(244,237,224,0.12);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:26px 22px;
    transition:transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .kit-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-1deg);border-color:var(--brass);}
  .kit-card svg{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--lagoon);margin-bottom:16px;}
  .kit-card h3{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;}
  .kit-card p{font-size:0.9rem;color:rgba(244,237,224,0.7);line-height:1.55;margin:0;}

  .tool-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;}
  .tool-badge{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.03em;
    color:var(--deep-tide);background:var(--sand);
    border:1.5px solid var(--brass);
    padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;
    transform:rotate(var(--r,0deg));
  }
  .tool-badge:nth-child(odd){--r:-2deg;}
  .tool-badge:nth-child(even){--r:2deg;}

  /* ---------- ekspedisi / portfolio ---------- */
  .expedition-card{
    background:var(--sand);
    border:2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:36px;
    box-shadow:8px 8px 0 rgba(11,46,51,0.12);
    margin-bottom:28px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:32px;
  }
  .expedition-card .meta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0 18px;}
  .pill{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;
    text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;
    background:var(--foam);color:var(--deep-tide);
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  }
  .expedition-card h3{font-size:1.7rem;}
  .expedition-card p.desc{line-height:1.7;font-size:1rem;color:rgba(11,46,51,0.85);}
  .expedition-visual{
    background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--lagoon), var(--deep-tide));
    border-radius:12px;
    min-height:220px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    color:var(--sand);font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.8rem;text-align:center;padding:20px;
    border:1px dashed rgba(244,237,224,0.5);
  }
  .btn-row{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;}
  @media (max-width:820px){ .expedition-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  .postcard-empty{
    border:2px dashed rgba(11,46,51,0.3);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:30px 32px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    gap:20px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .postcard-empty .eyebrow{color:rgba(11,46,51,0.4);}
  .postcard-empty h4{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.2rem;margin:8px 0 4px;color:rgba(11,46,51,0.55);}
  .postcard-empty p{margin:0;color:rgba(11,46,51,0.45);font-size:0.92rem;max-width:380px;}
  .postcard-empty .plus{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:2rem;color:rgba(11,46,51,0.25);
    border:2px dashed rgba(11,46,51,0.25);border-radius:50%;
    width:52px;height:52px;flex:none;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }

  /* ---------- kontak ---------- */
  .contact-wrap{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;
  }
  .postcard{
    background:var(--sand);color:var(--ink);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:38px;
    position:relative;
    box-shadow:10px 10px 0 rgba(201,162,39,0.35);
  }
  .postcard h3{font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .postcard p{line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:26px;color:rgba(11,46,51,0.75);}
  .contact-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
  .contact-link{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.9rem;
    text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);
    padding:14px 18px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px;
    transition:background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .contact-link:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--sand);}
  .contact-link svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none;}
  .postmark{
    position:absolute;top:24px;right:28px;
    width:70px;height:70px;border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid var(--coral);color:var(--coral);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.6rem;
    text-align:center;line-height:1.3;text-transform:uppercase;
    transform:rotate(8deg);
  }
  @media (max-width:820px){ .contact-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .postmark{display:none;} }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{background:var(--deep-tide);color:rgba(244,237,224,0.6);padding:44px 0 30px;text-align:center;}
  footer .compass-mini{width:28px;height:28px;margin:0 auto 14px;animation:spin 60s linear infinite;color:var(--brass);}
  footer .coords{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:6px;}
  footer .credit{font-size:0.8rem;}

  /* ---------- scroll-to-top ---------- */
  .to-top{
    position:fixed;bottom:26px;right:26px;z-index:55;
    width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--deep-tide);color:var(--brass);
    border:2px solid var(--brass);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    cursor:pointer;
    opacity:0;pointer-events:none;
    transform:translateY(10px);
    transition:opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .to-top.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translateY(0);}
  .to-top svg{width:24px;height:24px;animation:spin 60s linear infinite;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="tide-gauge" aria-hidden="true"><div class="tide-fill" id="tideFill"></div></div>

  <nav class="compass-nav">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="#beranda" class="nav-brand">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="46" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M50 14 L58 50 L50 86 L42 50 Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        DSW
      </a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Buka menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="#beranda" data-nav>Beranda</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tentang" data-nav>Tentang</a></li>
        <li><a href="#kelengkapan" data-nav>Kelengkapan</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ekspedisi" data-nav>Ekspedisi</a></li>
        <li><a href="#kontak" data-nav>Kontak</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <header class="hero" id="beranda">
    <div class="bubbles" id="bubbles"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div class="monogram">DSW</div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Logbook Kreatif — Entri 001</div>
      <h1>Detty Savira <br><em>Wardhani</em></h1>
      <div class="tagline-badge">Creative Multi-Hyphenate</div>
      <p class="lede">Menyusuri pekerjaan kreatif dari satu pesisir ke pesisir lain — desain visual, kata-kata, strategi konten, sampai video — dan mencatat semuanya di sini, satu halaman logbook demi satu halaman.</p>
      <a href="#ekspedisi" class="stamp-btn">Buka Logbook ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div class="wave-divider">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="wave-anim"><path fill="#0B2E33" d="M0,40 C 200,90 400,0 720,40 C 1040,80 1240,0 1440,40 L1440,100 L0,100 Z"/></svg>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- ============ TENTANG ============ -->
    <section class="page sand" id="tentang">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="page-head reveal">
          <div class="eyebrow">Halaman 01 — Awak Kapal</div>
          <h2>Tentang saya</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="reveal">
            <p>Saya bekerja di persimpangan antara <strong>visual, kata-kata, dan strategi konten</strong> — merancang desain, menulis naskah, mengelola sosial media, menyusun rencana konten, sampai mengedit video dan reels dari awal sampai tayang.</p>
            <p>Buat saya, satu brief sering butuh lebih dari satu keahlian sekaligus. Jadi daripada berhenti di satu peran, saya belajar membaca kebutuhan tiap project seperti membaca arah angin — lalu menyesuaikan alat yang paling pas untuk sampai ke tujuan.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="coord-card reveal">
            <div><span class="dot">●</span> ROLE: Graphic Design</div>
            <div><span class="dot">●</span> ROLE: Copywriting</div>
            <div><span class="dot">●</span> ROLE: Social Media Mgmt.</div>
            <div><span class="dot">●</span> ROLE: Content Planning</div>
            <div><span class="dot">●</span> ROLE: Video Editing / Reels</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ KELENGKAPAN (skills + tools) ============ -->
    <section class="page tide" id="kelengkapan">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="page-head reveal">
          <div class="eyebrow">Halaman 02 — Perlengkapan</div>
          <h2>Yang selalu saya bawa</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="kit-grid">
          <div class="kit-card reveal">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 15c-1.5 1.5-2 3-2 4.5C7.5 20.5 8 21 9 21c1.5 0 3-.5 4.5-2M15 9l-6 6M13 3l8 8-2 2-8-8 2-2z"/></svg>
            <h3>Graphic Design</h3>
            <p>Identitas visual, materi sosial media, sampai layout cetak — dari sketsa sampai file siap naik.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="kit-card reveal">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l4-1 11-11a2 2 0 00-3-3L5 16l-1 4z"/><path d="M14 6l3 3"/></svg>
            <h3>Copywriting</h3>
            <p>Kata-kata yang punya tujuan — dari caption yang bikin berhenti scroll sampai naskah kampanye.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="kit-card reveal">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 11l18-7-7 18-2-8-9-3z"/></svg>
            <h3>Social Media Management</h3>
            <p>Menjaga akun tetap hidup dan konsisten — dari kalender posting sampai interaksi harian.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="kit-card reveal">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h9" stroke-dasharray="1 4"/><circle cx="19" cy="18" r="2"/></svg>
            <h3>Content Planning</h3>
            <p>Menyusun rute konten sebelum jalan — tema, jadwal, dan tujuan yang jelas di tiap unggahan.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="kit-card reveal">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M3 7l3-4h4l-3 4M13 7l3-4h4l-3 4"/></svg>
            <h3>Video Editing &amp; Reels</h3>
            <p>Memotong, menyusun ritme, dan menambahkan sentuhan akhir supaya video enak ditonton sampai habis.</p>
          </div>
